{
  "info": {
    "name": "Workbench - Plataforma (todos os microsserviços)",
    "description": "Collection unificada dos 4 microsserviços da plataforma Workbench (Fase 4).\n\nCada serviço tem sua baseUrl (localmente, uma porta por serviço). Importe junto o environment 'Workbench - Local' (workbench-local.postman_environment.json) e selecione-o no canto superior direito do Postman.\n\nVariáveis: customerUrl (8081), osUrl (8080), billingUrl (8082), executionUrl (8083), gatewayUrl (8080), token (JWT staff), e variáveis capturadas em runtime (clientId, productId, orderId, gatewayPaymentId).\n\nSEGURANCA: TODOS os servicos agora exigem JWT (Bearer) — menos as rotas publicas: login (/auth, /auth/login), o webhook de pagamento e health/swagger. A collection ja envia o token em todas as requisicoes (auth Bearer {{token}} no nivel da collection); as rotas publicas usam 'No Auth' individualmente.\n\nAUTENTICACAO LOCAL: a Lambda de login so existe na AWS. Localmente, use o token dev ja preenchido no environment (staff ADMIN, HS256 com o secret compartilhado). A pasta 'Autenticacao' documenta os endpoints reais para quando houver o Gateway no ar.\n\nA pasta 'Fluxo Saga (E2E)' executa o caminho feliz ponta a ponta na ordem correta — rode de cima para baixo (ou use o Collection Runner). A cobranca e criada AUTOMATICAMENTE ao entrar em PAGAMENTO_PENDENTE; o passo 'Buscar cobranca' pega o checkoutUrl (link de pagamento).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {"key": "gatewayUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8080"},
    {"key": "customerUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8081"},
    {"key": "osUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8080"},
    {"key": "billingUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8082"},
    {"key": "executionUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8083"},
    {"key": "cpfCnpj", "value": "52998224725"},
    {"key": "placa", "value": "ABC-1234"},
    {"key": "token", "value": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJhZG1pbkB3b3JrYmVuY2guZGV2Iiwicm9sZXMiOlsiQURNSU4iXSwiaWF0IjoxNzkyODAwOTQzLCJleHAiOjE4MjQzMzY5NDN9.RSEIF6etTjYgzwC2gqyXFinopqMm3f47lZp79qdYeCw"},
    {"key": "clientId", "value": ""},
    {"key": "productId", "value": ""},
    {"key": "orderId", "value": ""},
    {"key": "gatewayPaymentId", "value": ""}
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{"key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string"}]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Autenticação (via Gateway - só na AWS)",
      "description": "Login de cliente (CPF) e de staff (e-mail/senha). Ambos públicos, atendidos pela Lambda atrás do API Gateway. SÓ FUNCIONA NA AWS. Localmente, use o token dev já preenchido no environment. O login staff, quando usado contra o Gateway, captura o token automaticamente.",
      "item": [
        {"name": "Login cliente (CPF)", "request": {"method": "POST", "auth": {"type": "noauth"}, "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}], "url": {"raw": "{{gatewayUrl}}/auth", "host": ["{{gatewayUrl}}"], "path": ["auth"]}, "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"cpf\": \"529.982.247-25\"\n}"}}},
        {"name": "Login staff (e-mail/senha)", "event": [{"listen": "test", "script": {"type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["if (pm.response.code === 200) { var v=pm.response.json().token; pm.environment.set('token', v); pm.collectionVariables.set('token', v); }"]}}], "request": {"method": "POST", "auth": {"type": "noauth"}, "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}], "url": {"raw": "{{gatewayUrl}}/auth/login", "host": ["{{gatewayUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "login"]}, "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@workbench.dev\",\n  \"password\": \"admin123\"\n}"}}}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Customer Service",
      "item": [
        {"name": "Cadastrar usuário staff (signup)", "request": {"method": "POST", "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}], "url": {"raw": "{{customerUrl}}/api/users/signup", "host": ["{{customerUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "users", "signup"]}, "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"tecnico@workbench.dev\",\n  \"password\": \"segredo123\",\n  \"roles\": [\"TECHNICIAN\"]\n}"}}},
        {"name": "Criar cliente", "event": [{"listen": "test", "script": {"type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["if (pm.response.code === 201) { var v=pm.response.json().id; pm.environment.set('clientId', v); pm.collectionVariables.set('clientId', v); }"]}}], "request": {"method": "POST", "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}], "url": {"raw": "{{customerUrl}}/api/clients", "host": ["{{customerUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "clients"]}, "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Maria Oliveira\",\n  \"document\": \"52998224725\",\n  \"email\": \"maria@example.com\",\n  \"phone\": \"11999990000\"\n}"}}},
        {"name": "Criar veículo", "request": {"method": "POST", "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}], "url": {"raw": "{{customerUrl}}/api/vehicles", "host": ["{{customerUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "vehicles"]}, "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"clientId\": {{clientId}},\n  \"plate\": \"ABC-1234\",\n  \"brand\": \"Volkswagen\",\n  \"model\": \"Gol\",\n  \"year\": 2018,\n  \"color\": \"Prata\",\n  \"type\": \"CARRO\"\n}"}}},
        {"name": "Listar clientes", "request": {"method": "GET", "url": {"raw": "{{customerUrl}}/api/clients", "host": ["{{customerUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "clients"]}}},
        {"name": "Buscar cliente por documento", "request": {"method": "GET", "url": {"raw": "{{customerUrl}}/api/clients/document/{{cpfCnpj}}", "host": ["{{customerUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "clients", "document", "{{cpfCnpj}}"]}}},
        {"name": "Buscar veículo por placa", "request": {"method": "GET", "url": {"raw": "{{customerUrl}}/api/vehicles/plate/{{placa}}", "host": ["{{customerUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "vehicles", "plate", "{{placa}}"]}}}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Execution Service",
      "item": [
        {"name": "Criar produto", "event": [{"listen": "prerequest", "script": {"type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["pm.variables.set('sku', 'OLEO-5W30-' + Date.now());"]}}, {"listen": "test", "script": {"type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["if (pm.response.code === 201) { var v=pm.response.json().id; pm.environment.set('productId', v); pm.collectionVariables.set('productId', v); }"]}}], "request": {"method": "POST", "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}], "url": {"raw": "{{executionUrl}}/api/products", "host": ["{{executionUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "products"]}, "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Óleo 5W30\",\n  \"sku\": \"{{sku}}\",\n  \"type\": \"PART\",\n  \"unit\": \"UNIT\",\n  \"category\": \"Lubrificantes\",\n  \"brand\": \"Mobil\",\n  \"costPrice\": 25.00,\n  \"salePrice\": 45.00,\n  \"warrantyMonths\": 6,\n  \"fractionalAllowed\": false,\n  \"packageSize\": 1\n}"}}},
        {"name": "Criar estoque", "request": {"method": "POST", "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}], "url": {"raw": "{{executionUrl}}/api/stocks", "host": ["{{executionUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "stocks"]}, "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"productId\": \"{{productId}}\",\n  \"quantity\": 100,\n  \"minimumQuantity\": 10\n}"}}},
        {"name": "Listar produtos", "request": {"method": "GET", "url": {"raw": "{{executionUrl}}/api/products", "host": ["{{executionUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "products"]}}},
        {"name": "Listar estoques", "request": {"method": "GET", "url": {"raw": "{{executionUrl}}/api/stocks", "host": ["{{executionUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "stocks"]}}},
        {"name": "Estoque por produto", "request": {"method": "GET", "url": {"raw": "{{executionUrl}}/api/stocks/product/{{productId}}", "host": ["{{executionUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "stocks", "product", "{{productId}}"]}}}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "OS Service",
      "item": [
        {"name": "Criar OS", "event": [{"listen": "test", "script": {"type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["if (pm.response.code === 201) { var v=pm.response.json().id; pm.environment.set('orderId', v); pm.collectionVariables.set('orderId', v); }"]}}], "request": {"method": "POST", "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}], "url": {"raw": "{{osUrl}}/order", "host": ["{{osUrl}}"], "path": ["order"]}, "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"cpfCnpj\": \"{{cpfCnpj}}\",\n  \"placaVeiculo\": \"{{placa}}\",\n  \"serviceTypes\": [\"TROCA_OLEO\"]\n}"}}},
        {"name": "Registrar diagnóstico (dispara a Saga)", "request": {"method": "POST", "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}], "url": {"raw": "{{osUrl}}/order/{{orderId}}/diagnosis", "host": ["{{osUrl}}"], "path": ["order", "{{orderId}}", "diagnosis"]}, "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"parts\": [ { \"productId\": \"{{productId}}\", \"quantity\": 2 } ],\n  \"services\": [ { \"serviceType\": \"TROCA_OLEO\", \"laborCost\": 80.00, \"useDefault\": false } ]\n}"}}},
        {"name": "Listar OS", "request": {"method": "GET", "url": {"raw": "{{osUrl}}/order", "host": ["{{osUrl}}"], "path": ["order"]}}},
        {"name": "Buscar OS por ID", "request": {"method": "GET", "url": {"raw": "{{osUrl}}/order/id/{{orderId}}", "host": ["{{osUrl}}"], "path": ["order", "id", "{{orderId}}"]}}},
        {"name": "Buscar OS por documento", "request": {"method": "GET", "url": {"raw": "{{osUrl}}/order/document/{{cpfCnpj}}", "host": ["{{osUrl}}"], "path": ["order", "document", "{{cpfCnpj}}"]}}},
        {"name": "Aprovar orçamento", "request": {"method": "POST", "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}], "url": {"raw": "{{osUrl}}/order/{{orderId}}/decision", "host": ["{{osUrl}}"], "path": ["order", "{{orderId}}", "decision"]}, "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"decision\": \"APPROVED\"\n}"}}},
        {"name": "Recusar orçamento", "request": {"method": "POST", "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}], "url": {"raw": "{{osUrl}}/order/{{orderId}}/decision", "host": ["{{osUrl}}"], "path": ["order", "{{orderId}}", "decision"]}, "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"decision\": \"REJECTED\",\n  \"reason\": \"Cliente nao aprovou\"\n}"}}},
        {"name": "Monitoring - tempo médio por tipo", "request": {"method": "POST", "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}], "url": {"raw": "{{osUrl}}/monitoring/all", "host": ["{{osUrl}}"], "path": ["monitoring", "all"]}, "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"timeUnit\": \"HOURS\"\n}"}}}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Billing Service",
      "item": [
        {"name": "Buscar orçamento da OS", "request": {"method": "GET", "url": {"raw": "{{billingUrl}}/api/budgets/service-order/{{orderId}}", "host": ["{{billingUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "budgets", "service-order", "{{orderId}}"]}}},
        {"name": "Buscar pagamento da OS (captura gatewayPaymentId)", "event": [{"listen": "test", "script": {"type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["if (pm.response.code === 200) { var v=pm.response.json().gatewayPaymentId; pm.environment.set('gatewayPaymentId', v); pm.collectionVariables.set('gatewayPaymentId', v); }"]}}], "request": {"method": "GET", "url": {"raw": "{{billingUrl}}/api/payments/service-order/{{orderId}}", "host": ["{{billingUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "payments", "service-order", "{{orderId}}"]}}},
        {"name": "Criar cobrança (manual; normalmente é automática via Saga)", "event": [{"listen": "test", "script": {"type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["if (pm.response.code === 201) { var v=pm.response.json().gatewayPaymentId; pm.environment.set('gatewayPaymentId', v); pm.collectionVariables.set('gatewayPaymentId', v); }"]}}], "request": {"method": "POST", "url": {"raw": "{{billingUrl}}/api/payments/service-order/{{orderId}}", "host": ["{{billingUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "payments", "service-order", "{{orderId}}"]}}},
        {"name": "Webhook de pagamento (aprovar)", "request": {"method": "POST", "auth": {"type": "noauth"}, "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}], "url": {"raw": "{{billingUrl}}/api/payments/webhook", "host": ["{{billingUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "payments", "webhook"]}, "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"gatewayPaymentId\": \"{{gatewayPaymentId}}\",\n  \"approved\": true\n}"}}},
        {"name": "Histórico de pagamento", "request": {"method": "GET", "url": {"raw": "{{billingUrl}}/api/payments/service-order/{{orderId}}/history", "host": ["{{billingUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "payments", "service-order", "{{orderId}}", "history"]}}}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Fluxo Saga (E2E - caminho feliz)",
      "description": "Execute na ordem, de cima para baixo (ou via Collection Runner). Cria cliente/veículo/produto/estoque, cria a OS, registra diagnóstico (dispara a Saga), aprova o orçamento, AVANÇA O SERVIÇO pela máquina de estados (EM_EXECUCAO -> FINALIZADA -> PAGAMENTO_PENDENTE via PATCH). Ao entrar em PAGAMENTO_PENDENTE (passo 12), a cobrança é criada AUTOMATICAMENTE pela Saga; o passo 13 só BUSCA o gatewayPaymentId dessa cobrança. O passo 14 confirma o pagamento via webhook. clientId, productId, orderId e gatewayPaymentId são capturados automaticamente.\n\nAguarde ~2-3s depois do passo 6 (diagnóstico dispara a Saga que gera o orçamento), depois do passo 12 (cobrança automática) e depois do passo 14 (webhook publica PagamentoConfirmado, que o os-service consome para levar a OS a PAGO->ENTREGUE). O webhook só tem efeito com a OS em PAGAMENTO_PENDENTE.",
      "item": [
        {"name": "1. Criar cliente (idempotente)", "event": [{"listen": "test", "script": {"type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["function save(v){ pm.environment.set('clientId', v); pm.collectionVariables.set('clientId', v); }", "if (pm.response.code === 201) {", "  save(pm.response.json().id);", "} else {", "  // já existe (409) ou outro: busca o id pelo documento", "  pm.sendRequest({ url: pm.variables.replaceIn('{{customerUrl}}/api/clients/document/{{cpfCnpj}}'), method: 'GET', header: { 'Authorization': 'Bearer ' + pm.variables.get('token') } }, function (err, res) {", "    if (!err && res.code === 200) { save(res.json().id); }", "  });", "}"]}}], "request": {"method": "POST", "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}], "url": {"raw": "{{customerUrl}}/api/clients", "host": ["{{customerUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "clients"]}, "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Maria Oliveira\",\n  \"document\": \"52998224725\",\n  \"email\": \"maria@example.com\",\n  \"phone\": \"11999990000\"\n}"}}},
        {"name": "2. Criar veículo", "request": {"method": "POST", "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}], "url": {"raw": "{{customerUrl}}/api/vehicles", "host": ["{{customerUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "vehicles"]}, "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"clientId\": {{clientId}},\n  \"plate\": \"ABC-1234\",\n  \"brand\": \"Volkswagen\",\n  \"model\": \"Gol\",\n  \"year\": 2018,\n  \"color\": \"Prata\",\n  \"type\": \"CARRO\"\n}"}}},
        {"name": "3. Criar produto", "event": [{"listen": "prerequest", "script": {"type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["pm.variables.set('sku', 'OLEO-5W30-' + Date.now());"]}}, {"listen": "test", "script": {"type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["if (pm.response.code === 201) { var v=pm.response.json().id; pm.environment.set('productId', v); pm.collectionVariables.set('productId', v); }"]}}], "request": {"method": "POST", "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}], "url": {"raw": "{{executionUrl}}/api/products", "host": ["{{executionUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "products"]}, "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Óleo 5W30\",\n  \"sku\": \"{{sku}}\",\n  \"type\": \"PART\",\n  \"unit\": \"UNIT\",\n  \"category\": \"Lubrificantes\",\n  \"brand\": \"Mobil\",\n  \"costPrice\": 25.00,\n  \"salePrice\": 45.00,\n  \"warrantyMonths\": 6,\n  \"fractionalAllowed\": false,\n  \"packageSize\": 1\n}"}}},
        {"name": "4. Criar estoque", "request": {"method": "POST", "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}], "url": {"raw": "{{executionUrl}}/api/stocks", "host": ["{{executionUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "stocks"]}, "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"productId\": \"{{productId}}\",\n  \"quantity\": 100,\n  \"minimumQuantity\": 10\n}"}}},
        {"name": "5. Criar OS", "event": [{"listen": "test", "script": {"type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["if (pm.response.code === 201) { var v=pm.response.json().id; pm.environment.set('orderId', v); pm.collectionVariables.set('orderId', v); }"]}}], "request": {"method": "POST", "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}], "url": {"raw": "{{osUrl}}/order", "host": ["{{osUrl}}"], "path": ["order"]}, "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"cpfCnpj\": \"{{cpfCnpj}}\",\n  \"placaVeiculo\": \"{{placa}}\",\n  \"serviceTypes\": [\"TROCA_OLEO\"]\n}"}}},
        {"name": "6. Registrar diagnóstico (dispara a Saga)", "request": {"method": "POST", "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}], "url": {"raw": "{{osUrl}}/order/{{orderId}}/diagnosis", "host": ["{{osUrl}}"], "path": ["order", "{{orderId}}", "diagnosis"]}, "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"parts\": [ { \"productId\": \"{{productId}}\", \"quantity\": 2 } ],\n  \"services\": [ { \"serviceType\": \"TROCA_OLEO\", \"laborCost\": 80.00, \"useDefault\": false } ]\n}"}}},
        {"name": "7. Consultar orçamento gerado (aguarde ~2-3s)", "request": {"method": "GET", "url": {"raw": "{{billingUrl}}/api/budgets/service-order/{{orderId}}", "host": ["{{billingUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "budgets", "service-order", "{{orderId}}"]}}},
        {"name": "8. Conferir OS em AGUARDANDO_APROVACAO", "request": {"method": "GET", "url": {"raw": "{{osUrl}}/order/id/{{orderId}}", "host": ["{{osUrl}}"], "path": ["order", "id", "{{orderId}}"]}}},
        {"name": "9. Aprovar orçamento", "request": {"method": "POST", "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}], "url": {"raw": "{{osUrl}}/order/{{orderId}}/decision", "host": ["{{osUrl}}"], "path": ["order", "{{orderId}}", "decision"]}, "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"decision\": \"APPROVED\"\n}"}}},
        {"name": "10. Iniciar execução (APROVADO -> EM_EXECUCAO)", "request": {"method": "PATCH", "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}], "url": {"raw": "{{osUrl}}/order/{{orderId}}", "host": ["{{osUrl}}"], "path": ["order", "{{orderId}}"]}, "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"status\": \"EM_EXECUCAO\"\n}"}}},
        {"name": "11. Finalizar serviço (EM_EXECUCAO -> FINALIZADA)", "request": {"method": "PATCH", "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}], "url": {"raw": "{{osUrl}}/order/{{orderId}}", "host": ["{{osUrl}}"], "path": ["order", "{{orderId}}"]}, "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"status\": \"FINALIZADA\"\n}"}}},
        {"name": "12. Marcar pagamento pendente (dispara cobrança automática)", "request": {"method": "PATCH", "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}], "url": {"raw": "{{osUrl}}/order/{{orderId}}", "host": ["{{osUrl}}"], "path": ["order", "{{orderId}}"]}, "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"status\": \"PAGAMENTO_PENDENTE\"\n}"}}},
        {"name": "13. Buscar cobrança (aguarde ~2-3s; captura gatewayPaymentId)", "event": [{"listen": "test", "script": {"type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["if (pm.response.code === 200) { var v=pm.response.json().gatewayPaymentId; pm.environment.set('gatewayPaymentId', v); pm.collectionVariables.set('gatewayPaymentId', v); }"]}}], "request": {"method": "GET", "url": {"raw": "{{billingUrl}}/api/payments/service-order/{{orderId}}", "host": ["{{billingUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "payments", "service-order", "{{orderId}}"]}}},
        {"name": "14. Webhook de pagamento aprovado (aguarde ~2-3s depois)", "request": {"method": "POST", "auth": {"type": "noauth"}, "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}], "url": {"raw": "{{billingUrl}}/api/payments/webhook", "host": ["{{billingUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "payments", "webhook"]}, "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"gatewayPaymentId\": \"{{gatewayPaymentId}}\",\n  \"approved\": true\n}"}}},
        {"name": "15. Conferir OS final (ENTREGUE)", "request": {"method": "GET", "url": {"raw": "{{osUrl}}/order/id/{{orderId}}", "host": ["{{osUrl}}"], "path": ["order", "id", "{{orderId}}"]}}}
      ]
    }
  ]
}
